          "title": "You'll want to know: 气候",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "气候 — qìhòu — \"climate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "西边的气候不好风很大 xībiān de qìhòu bù hǎo fēng hěn dà — The climate in the west isn't good: it's very windy."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
